  "bullets": [
    "Volumes: Heart + liver + lung (Strata's core flying organs) rose 5.8% over the last 4 weeks vs. last year; by organ, heart and kidney were roughly flat (-1.4%, -1.5%); liver and lung rose 8.3% and 7.3%.",
    "Quarter: Q3 heart+liver+lung \u25b2 5.2% YoY; \u25bc 5.8% vs Q2 (typical Q2\u2192Q3: \u25bc 4.2%).",
    "Donors: Deceased donors recovered rose 13.0% over the last 4 weeks vs. last year, and 20.5% of recovered organs have been discarded so far this year (19.6% a year earlier).",
    "Donor mix & distance: DCD donors are 53.5% of deceased donors so far this year, up from 49.2% in 2025; est. avg distance (2026 YTD vs 2025): lung 429 NM (\u22127.0%), liver 195 NM (\u22122.9%), heart 318 NM (\u22121.3%).",
    "Waitlist: Heart+liver+lung waitlist additions rose (+2.3%) over the last 4 weeks vs. last year; by organ, heart and lung rose 3.5% and 3.2%; liver was roughly flat (+1.6%); kidney fell 3.9%.",
    "Regions: biggest moves over the last 4 weeks vs. last year: Northwest (Region 6) \u25b2 31.4%, Mid-Atlantic (Region 2) \u25b2 11.0%, New England (Region 1) \u25bc 8.7%."
  ],
